import Foundation

/// Corrections to Music entries (see setu-knowledge-audit-music.md, sections 2, 3b, 3c and 5): stale text about a toolbar that no longer exists, wrong paths, thin one-liners, and the titles that were code names.
/// Laid over the entries after the declarations merge (`AtlasRefine`). The current shell has no toolbar: a Back pill, a round side-panel button, a sidebar with Library, Playlists and Recent groups, a personal Listen Now,
/// a regional Explore, and a floating player bar.
enum MusicRefinements {
